# What a build from a local folder (`docker build`, `railway up`) must never send to the
# builder. Railway's builds from GitHub only see committed files, but a local build
# context isn't filtered by git, so without these lines the local data, including
# Tiingo's raw prices, and the API keys in .env would be uploaded.
data/
*.duckdb
.env
.env.*

# Not needed in the image.
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
tests/
scripts/
app/data/samples/
spikes/*
!spikes/hosting.py
